## Error Title
Permission Denied

---

## Error ID
KE-PERM-001

---

## Error Description
403 Forbidden

---

## Root Cause
The user or service account lacks required permissions.

---

## Resolution
- Review access roles and policies.
- Grant the necessary permissions.
- Validate IAM or application authorization settings.
- Retry the operation after access updates.

